'''Play! Pokémon Prize Pack Series Nine''' is a series of promotional cards released on July 1st, 2026 through [[Play! Pokémon|Pokémon Organized Play]] events or affiliated products. This features specifically selected cards from the {{TCG|Journey Together}} expansion through {{TCG|Perfect Order}}, including {{TCG|MEE Basic Energies|MEE prints}} of {{TCG|Energy Card|Basic Energy Cards}}. All cards retained their original set number, but are marked with the Play! Pokémon logo. Each Booster pack contains 6 cards. Foil cards in this set have Cosmos Holofoil except for {{TCG|Pokémon ex}}, which retain their regular foil patterns.

